{"product":{"id":6236189458620,"title":"Norix Max-Master - 42” Round Metal Table with 4 Seats - Model M4-4200","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Max-Master 42\" round table seats four and is built for the daily demands of dining halls and dayrooms. Each seat has its own steel leg, giving the table more stability than a single pedestal base, whether it's bolted down or set on tamper-resistant glides. Scratch- and stain-resistant composite seats and Torx tamper-resistant hardware keep it secure and easy to maintain.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTop Size: 42\" round\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdge Style: Laminated tops have Molded Edge, Stainless Steel top has Self Edge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEdge Color \/ Top Color choices:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack edge + Titanium Evolve top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWild Cherry edge + Wild Cherry top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKensington Maple edge + Kensington Maple top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAsian Sun edge + Asian Sun top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMontana Walnut edge + Montana Walnut top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGraham Cracker edge + Palisades Oak top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHM Innertone Light edge + Calcutta Marble top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack edge + Black Alicante top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBlack edge + Titanium Evolve Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStainless Steel edge + Stainless Steel top wrapped around Quietcore (S05)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeg type: 3\" Leg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLeg colors: Black or Metallic Silver\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSeats: 13” (33 cm) diameter seats made of Super Slammer Stone high-density, color-impregnated, compression-molded composite that is highly scratch and stain resistant. Four molded-in threaded inserts for superior metal-to-metal connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSeat colors: Twilight, Cove, Sand, Raven, Stainless Steel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdditional charge applies for Stainless Steel top, Stainless Steel seats, or Game Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight 183 lbs laminate top, 174 lbs Stainless Steel Top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpecify bolt-down or free-standing options:\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBolt down (hardware included)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTamper-resistant leg glides (cannot be added later if bolt-down option is ordered)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClear PVC leg protectors, 3\" diameter x 6\" high, may be used with either bolt-down or glide option. Must be specified on order\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShips K.D. (knocked down) to save shipping cost\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eADA option: all Max-Master table configurations are available in an ADA version with legs configured to accommodate wheelchair access. Designed to be used \u003cbr\u003eonly with bolt-down option. No extra charge. Contact us for complete details\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eStandard hardware included: Torx tamper-resistant screws, precoated with Dri-Loc sealant\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications \/ Ideal Environments\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix Max-Master tables are designed for dining halls and dayrooms in correctional, detention, and other high-use institutional facilities. Individual steel seat legs, a bolt-down option, and Torx tamper-resistant hardware keep the table stable and secure in supervised spaces where furniture sees continuous daily use. An ADA configuration is also available at no extra charge for wheelchair-accessible seating.  Check out Anchortex’s full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/bh-behavioral-healthcare-furniture\" title=\"Behavioral Health Furniture\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ebehavioral health furniture\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/cd-correctional-furniture\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Prison and detention furniture\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003eprison and detention furniture\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Furniture\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix manufactures durable furniture and furnishings designed for demanding environments. Norix products are widely used in behavioral healthcare, correctional, detention, residential treatment, and other high-use institutional settings. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/norix-furniture\" title=\"Norix Furniture\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eNorix furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T13:16:33-05:00","handle":"norix-max-master-4-seat-round-table","updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:32:53-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T13:16:33-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dayrooms, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dining-areas, cd-furn-cafeteria, cd-furn-dayroom, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":37961006547132,"product_id":6236189458620,"title":"42\" Round, Molded Edge, Solid Top \/ Bolt Down Plate","price":"1637.60","sku":"N700126-02","position":1,"compare_at_price":"2047.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"42\" Round, Molded Edge, Solid Top","option2":"Bolt Down Plate","option3":null,"created_at":"2021-01-29T13:16:34-05:00","updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:32:53-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"-","grams":115666,"image_id":null,"weight":255.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":37961006579900,"product_id":6236189458620,"title":"42\" Round, Molded Edge, Solid Top \/ Clear Leg Protector","price":"1717.60","sku":"N700126-03","position":2,"compa